flowchart LR
    MEDIA[Camera / image / video] --> API[FastAPI application :8000]
    UI[Browser dashboard] <--> API
    TG[Telegram bot] <--> API

    subgraph PIPELINE[Ordered incident decision pipeline]
        YOLO[1 · YOLO detection]
        SAM[2 · SAM segmentation]
        GEO[3 · ROI, intrusion and IoU]
        VISION[4 · Nemotron validation]
        GATE{Confirmed?}
        YOLO --> SAM --> GEO --> VISION --> GATE
    end

    API --> YOLO
    GATE -- Yes --> INCIDENT[Incident coordinator]
    GATE -- No --> EXPLAIN[Return decision and evidence to UI]

    subgraph AGENT[NVIDIA NeMo Agent Toolkit :8010]
        NAT[smart-facility-agent]
        QWEN[Qwen 2.5 control vLLM :8001]
        TOOLS[Five Smart Facility NAT tools]
        QWEN --> NAT --> TOOLS
    end

    TOOLS -. orchestrates .-> YOLO
    TOOLS -. orchestrates .-> SAM
    TOOLS -. orchestrates .-> VISION

    YOLO --> YOLOMODEL[yolo11n.pt]
    SAM --> SAMMODEL[SAM 2.1 tiny]
    VISION --> NEMOTRON[Nemotron vision vLLM :8002]

    INCIDENT --> DB[(SQLite)]
    INCIDENT --> FILES[Annotated evidence and crops]
    INCIDENT --> SOP[Local Markdown SOPs]
    INCIDENT --> EVENTS[Telegram + WebSocket]
    EVENTS --> UI
    EVENTS --> TG

    API -. configured fallback .-> YOLOMODEL
    API -. configured fallback .-> SAMMODEL
    API -. open-ended Telegram questions .-> QWEN

